## 6. Design System

**Single file:** `public/styles/tokens.css` + `public/styles/app.css`.

| Token group | Value | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| **Primary** | `--primary:#1D4ED8`, `--primary-hover:#1E40AF`, `--text-on-primary:#FFF` | Trust Indigo. **Never** orange/amber as primary — those are reserved for risk. |
| **Severity triplets** (bg/border/text) | Critical `#FEF2F2/#FECACA/#B91C1C` · Caution `#FFFBEB/#FDE68A/#B45309` · Safe `#ECFDF5/#A7F3D0/#047857` · Verify-OCR `#F0F9FF/#7DD3FC/#0369A1` (dashed underline) | Risk is unambiguous by color. |
| **Surfaces** | Light default (ink on paper) · Dark `#0B0F19`/`#1E293B`/`#F8FAFC` | Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`. |
| **Type — chrome** | System sans · body `15–16px/1.55` · clause headline `17–18px` · meta `12–13px` · rupee hero `26–32px bold` | +3px over Smart Resume for projector readability. |
| **Type — contract sheet** | Serif `Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif` · `16px/1.7` | Unmistakable separation between legal source and AI commentary. |
| **Icons/motion** | Inline SVG sprite (6–8 icons) · `0.18s` Material easing · `1100ms` clause pulse | Zero webfonts, zero external icon fonts. |

**Layout contract:** breakpoint at `900px`. Mobile `<900px` = zero-pinch card feed + 62px sticky bottom bar, **no stacked bottom sheets**. Desktop `≥900px` = `[ Report | Split | Contract ]` with `Split` default 48/52 + floating Ask drawer.

